#X text 10 36 Pots 1-8: the parameters of the page (pickup: a pot takes over once it passes the current value)., f 97;
#X text 10 51 CV-Lock: hold button 4 and turn a pot - that input stays on its parameter on every page (for CV)., f 97;
#X text 10 66   Again to unlock. The console names pages \, presets \, locks and modulation targets., f 82;
#X text 10 81 MIDI (USB): notes / pitch bend / program change = preset / CC: see the table in README., f 87;
#X text 10 96 Audio in 1 = external FM source (page SYNC-XMOD \, pot 6 = depth extfm)., f 70;
